## auth/register

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Zeyad",
    "email": "zeyad@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

## auth/verify-account

PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-account
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "zeyad@gmail.com",
    "code": "123456"
}
